299 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506462 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "b13e1f0f-637e-5903-9e37-6c5b9b407ce4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506508 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186506043 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506508 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506508 #edb/ref 1077 "field-2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506508 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186506043 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506508 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "fdfbe9d8-ba4d-594f-9b79-9657cca29157" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506519 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186506380 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506519 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186506417 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506519 #edb/ref 1069 "q-328381" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506519 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506519 #edb/ref 1071 "The center of the hyperbola ${x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}+6x+8y=-1$ is$\\,\\,($\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}\n$).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506519 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "1b9ba30c-75b9-548b-bbd4-b9dfefeaa769" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506519 #edb/ref 1074 "The equation of a horizontal hyperbola centered at $(h,k)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTo rewrite the equation of the hyperbola in standard form, we need to group $x$ and $y$ terms and complete the squares as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}+6x+8y & =-1 \\\\ {x}^{2}+6x\\,-\\,4{y}^{2}+8y & =-1 \\\\ [{x}^{2}+6x]\\,-\\,4[{y}^{2}-2y] & =-1 \\\\ [(x+3)^{2}-9]\\,-\\,4[(y-1)^{2}-1] & =-1 \\\\ (x+3)^{2}-9\\,-\\,4(y-1)^{2}+4 & =-1 \\\\ (x+3)^{2}-4(y-1)^{2} & =-1+9-4 \\\\ (x+3)^{2}-4(y-1)^{2} & =4 \\\\ \\frac{(x-(-3))^{2}}{{2}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{{1}^{2}} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the center of the hyperbola is $(\\,-3,1\\,).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506522 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186506424 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186506522 #edb/ref 1069 "q-10416" #edb/ref 17592186045417]